{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060678/block/singleImage/3250658/df/01M6045D0RDA0FRXB7NG7YHMK1.jpg?updatedAt=1793155078\"/><figcaption>港鐵青衣站女子遭非禮，56歲男子被捕(葵青警區FB)</figcaption></figure><p>警方葵青警區表示，周日(25日)接報一名男子在港鐵青衣站內非禮一名女子後，逃去無蹤。青衣分區特遣隊經深入調查和翻查大量閉路電視，成功鎖定一名涉案男子。周二(27日)採取行動，在青衣城巴士總站，以涉嫌「非禮」拘捕一名56歲本地男子，他現正被扣留作進一步調查。 警方嚴正呼籲「非禮」屬嚴重罪行，一經定罪，最高可被判處監禁10年。市民切勿因一時衝動而以身試法。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:08.196159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:07:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.030638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:20.602282+00:00","content_hash":"9e5b7ff9a718aa859d9c799af87b1522f139acb2b2d4065ebf3d391a34bc7b4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:08.196159+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}